{"title":"","link":"http://scripting.com/2026/01/05.html#a132946","date":1767619786000,"content":"<img src=\"https://imgs.scripting.com/2026/01/05/peets.png\" />I've tried a lot of different kinds of Keurig pods, but the best -- with the richest taste is <a href=\"https://www.peets.com/collections/all-coffees\">Peet's</a>. Just ordered a whole bunch more to try out. And btw, when I looked up Peet's on Google I found that it had been <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/keurig-dr-pepper-peets-acquisition-coffee-904c356a8eb57a6b256b7f45a0f59d8d\">bought by Dr Pepper</a> for (sit down please) $18 billion. I hope you didn't pass out. I always thought of Peet's as a <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Peet's+Coffee/@37.8803729,-122.2683059,3a,37.5y,186.58h,82.78t/data=!3m7!1e1!3m5!1sZwBhp-mi6kXN66mVlUTufA!2e0!6shttps:%2F%2Fstreetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com%2Fv1%2Fthumbnail%3Fcb_client%3Dmaps_sv.tactile%26w%3D900%26h%3D600%26pitch%3D7.217521607956982%26panoid%3DZwBhp-mi6kXN66mVlUTufA%26yaw%3D186.58228587981463!7i16384!8i8192!4m6!3m5!1s0x80857ea12b318d1d:0x1b0fe71cdb63e238!8m2!3d37.8802629!4d-122.2683283!16s%2Fg%2F1yl47h12q?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTIwOS4wIKXMDSoKLDEwMDc5MjA3M0gBUAM%3D\">hometown favorite</a>, the underdog, but my lord so much money. No wonder the coffee is so good.","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"29d57d17534bae137f136691f68aa172091696c4501d397e6e59ec15273ec694","category":"Sites"}